{"4459220":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Agile Team","steam_appid":4459220,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5317210],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead an Agile software team through a year of impossible deadlines, executive surprises, sprint planning, and workplace chaos.  Every decision shapes your team, your product, and your chance of shipping on time.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building software is hard.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building software while Sales promises impossible features, Marketing wants a flashy demo by Friday, executives invent new priorities every sprint, and developers insist &quot;it'll only take two more weeks&quot;... that's the real challenge.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agile Team<\/strong> is a humorous narrative management game where you step into the role of a Product Owner leading a software team racing to launch a brand-new video streaming platform in just one year.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sprint brings new challenges.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you protect your developers from endless interruptions or keep stakeholders happy?  Do you prioritize technical debt or ship the feature Marketing desperately needs?  Can you survive the latest executive initiative without derailing the entire roadmap?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no perfect decisions—only trade-offs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll guide sprint planning, manage personalities, balance morale against delivery, and navigate the wonderfully absurd realities of modern software development.  Every choice influences your team, your relationships, and ultimately whether your product launches successfully or not.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you've spent years in Agile—or simply enjoy strategy games driven by memorable characters and meaningful choices—you'll recognize the humour, frustration, and surprisingly human moments behind every sprint.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a software development team building a new video streaming service.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of unique developers, designers, managers, executives, and stakeholders with their own personalities and agendas.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make difficult decisions where every choice comes with consequences.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance delivery, quality, morale, technical debt, and stakeholder expectations.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience narrative events inspired by real software development stories.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover dozens of workplace situations every Agile professional secretly wishes were fictional.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your team, build the beta, then Launch!<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead an Agile software team through a year of impossible deadlines, executive surprises, sprint planning, and workplace chaos.  Every decision shapes your team, your product, and your chance of shipping on time.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building software is hard.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building software while Sales promises impossible features, Marketing wants a flashy demo by Friday, executives invent new priorities every sprint, and developers insist &quot;it'll only take two more weeks&quot;... that's the real challenge.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agile Team<\/strong> is a humorous narrative management game where you step into the role of a Product Owner leading a software team racing to launch a brand-new video streaming platform in just one year.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sprint brings new challenges.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you protect your developers from endless interruptions or keep stakeholders happy?  Do you prioritize technical debt or ship the feature Marketing desperately needs?  Can you survive the latest executive initiative without derailing the entire roadmap?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no perfect decisions—only trade-offs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll guide sprint planning, manage personalities, balance morale against delivery, and navigate the wonderfully absurd realities of modern software development.  Every choice influences your team, your relationships, and ultimately whether your product launches successfully or not.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you've spent years in Agile—or simply enjoy strategy games driven by memorable characters and meaningful choices—you'll recognize the humour, frustration, and surprisingly human moments behind every sprint.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a software development team building a new video streaming service.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of unique developers, designers, managers, executives, and stakeholders with their own personalities and agendas.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make difficult decisions where every choice comes with consequences.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance delivery, quality, morale, technical debt, and stakeholder expectations.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience narrative events inspired by real software development stories.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover dozens of workplace situations every Agile professional secretly wishes were fictional.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your team, build the beta, then Launch!<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Agile Team is a humorous narrative business management game where you step into the role of a Product Owner. Focus on the human side of software delivery: conflicting priorities, executive misunderstandings, office politics, sprint compromises, and the absurdity of modern software development.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4459220\/da9b1aada8112f61cff367e4c2d5f3f12d06f7bf\/header.jpg?t=1793717081","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4459220\/5cc33bc53fa069c53b309d80cf1a249ffa014ee9\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793717081","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4459220\/5cc33bc53fa069c53b309d80cf1a249ffa014ee9\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793717081","website":"https:\/\/www.agileteam.ca","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 2.0 GHz 64-bit processor<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> A GPU or CPU with integrated graphics supporting OpenGL 3.0 or DirectX 11 is required<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 2.0 GHz 64-bit processor<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> A GPU or CPU with integrated graphics supporting OpenGL 3.0 or DirectX 11 is required<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 10.14 or higher<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 2.0 GHz 64-bit Intel-compatible CPU or Apple Silicon (M1+)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.0 compatible<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 10.14 or higher<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 2.0 GHz 64-bit Intel-compatible CPU or Apple Silicon (M1+)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.0 compatible<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Agile Team"],"publishers":["Agile Team"],"demos":[{"appid":5317210,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":1299,"final":974,"discount_percent":25,"initial_formatted":"$12.99","final_formatted":"$9.74"},"packages":[1556604],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Agile Team","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1556604,"percent_savings_text":"-25% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Agile - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$12.99<\/span> $9.74","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":974}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":true,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":13,"description":"Captions available"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":75,"description":"Keyboard Only Option"},{"id":76,"description":"Mouse Only Option"},{"id":71,"description":"Narrated Game Menus"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":79,"description":"Save Anytime"},{"id":65,"description":"Subtitle Options"},{"id":77,"description":"Touch Only Option"},{"id":62,"descriptio